  "html": "<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/13;grid-row:1/2\"><div class=\"kicker\">02 · 场景价值决定投入优先级</div></div>\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/7;grid-row:2/4\">\n    <div class=\"t1\">TCL视觉质检准确率超90%</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/7;grid-row:4/5\">\n    <div class=\"b\">视觉检测已在生产制造环节形成相对成熟的应用模式。</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r lt\" style=\"grid-column:1/7;grid-row:5/7\">\n    <div class=\"t3\">生产周期同步缩短</div>\n    <div class=\"rowx base\"><div class=\"t3 red\">60%</div><div class=\"s\">TCL通过视觉技术开展液晶面板缺陷检测。</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/7;grid-row:7/9\">\n    <div class=\"call\">制造AI宜先投入输入、输出和验证标准清晰的视觉质检场景，再审慎进入实时生产控制。</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r mid\" style=\"grid-column:7/13;grid-row:2/7\">\n    <div class=\"d2 red\">超90%</div>\n    <div class=\"unit\">TCL液晶面板缺陷检测准确率</div>\n    <div class=\"units\"><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u on\"></div><div class=\"u\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"c\">准确率超过九成</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r lt\" style=\"grid-column:7/13;grid-row:7/9\">\n    <div class=\"t3\">实时生产仍需审慎</div>\n    <div class=\"s\">实时生产对质量管理、流程精度和高质量专业数据要求高，尚不能直接采用大模型“弱解释性”结果指导现场。</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"source\">资料来源：中国信息通信研究院《人工智能发展报告（2024年）》第 40–41 页</div><div class=\"pageno\">12</div>\n</div>",
